<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Innovasive raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Innovasive raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown &amp; Sons said on Monday it had raised its rating for Innovasive Devices Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's stock rose one to 8-1/2 in early trade.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
